inscription, le tarif correspondant incluant le repas.<br \/>\nNous vous attendons nombreux pour cette nouvelle \u00e9dition de la PimPim Cup !<br \/>\[long]<br \/>\nPimPim Cup 2026 \u2013 AST Roissy<br \/>\nAST Roissy is pleased to welcome you to the PimPim Cup 2026, an IPSC Level II match featuring 8 stages, with a minimum of approximately 200 rounds.<br \/>\nThe match will take place on Saturday, October 10 and Sunday, October 11, 2026, at the AST Roissy range - astroissy.fr<br \/>\nCompetitors can choose one of the following four sessions:<br \/>\nSaturday morning;<br \/>\nSaturday afternoon;<br \/>\nSunday morning;<br \/>\nSunday afternoon.<br \/>\nMorning sessions will start at 7:30 AM, afternoon sessions at 1:00 PM. Shooters should arrive early enough to complete check-in and attend the briefing.<br \/>\nSquads will be limited to 12 shooters maximum.<br \/>\nRegistration is done online through PractiScore. Shooters wishing to take part in multiple sessions must register separately for each one, repeating the registration process as many times as needed.<br \/>\nAfter registering, each shooter will receive an email containing a HelloAsso payment link. Registration will only be considered final once payment has been received. Once payment is confirmed, shooters will be able to squad themselves.<br \/>\nShooters will not be required to patch targets!<br \/>\nLunch will be available on Saturday and Sunday, at a price of \u20ac20 per person. Competitors wishing to have lunch on site must select the corresponding fee including the meal when registering.<br \/>\nWe look forward to welcoming you for this new edition of the PimPim Cup!<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"pimpim-cup-2026","image":false,"all_day":false,"start_date":"2026-10-07 05:00:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"07","hour":"05","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2026-10-11 18:00:00","end_date_details":{"year":"2026","month":"10","day":"11","hour":"18","minutes":"00","seconds