false,"virtual_url":null,"virtual_video_source":""},{"id":453497,"global_id":"gunstuff.tv?id=453497","global_id_lineage":["gunstuff.tv?id=453497","defenderoutdoors.com?id=10011806"],"author":"1","status":"publish","date":"2026-09-08 20:46:13","date_utc":"2026-09-09 03:46:13","modified":"2026-09-08 20:50:08","modified_utc":"2026-09-09 03:50:08","url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/event\/2026-fall-league\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/453497","title":"2026 Fall League","description":"<p><b>Dates:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>October 7<span class=\"s6\">th<\/span>, 14<span class=\"s6\">th<\/span>, 21<span class=\"s6\">st<\/span> , 28<span class=\"s6\">th<\/span>, November 4<span class=\"s6\">th<\/span>, 11<span class=\"s6\">th<\/span> and League Dinner Party\/Awards on November 18th.<\/p>\n<p>***Teams and Individuals can shoot anytime between Wednesday at 10AM and Sunday close of business each week.***<\/p>\n<p><b>Basics:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>League scores based on 50 targets per week. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>(Practice course and 5-stand will also be available prior and after weekly rounds)<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Targets:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>Enjoyable targets will be set by Course Manager Gary Madigan and Christian Daniels<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Price:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>Price for league is $250 for all 6 weeks which includes the League Party Dinner\/Awards <span class=\"s4\">(10% off for Members)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Teams:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>A minimum of 4 shooters per team is required to make a team and a maximum of 6 shooters.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Team scores will take the highest 4 shooters including handicap for the weekly total.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Team rosters must be determined prior to the end of the first week.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Individual shooters will be grouped together to create a team.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Shooters can only compete for one team per league.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Handicaps:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>Handicaps are calculated by using the shooter\u2019s weekly score, then subtracting it from \u201cpar\u201d, which is 45 and multiplying the difference times .70 (70%) Example:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>If a shooter\u2019s score is 30 the equation is 45-30=15 x .70 = 10.5.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>the product (in the example 10.5) will be added to the shooter\u2019s score.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Handicaps adjusted each week.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>Maximum score with handicap is 45.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Weather and Bank Rounds:<\/b><\/p>\n<p>If you are not able to make it on the scheduled evening, bank scores must be made up by Sunday of that week or you will be given an average of 2 other weeks scores for that week.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span>The same for weather related cancelations. <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><b>Additional Info:<\/b><\/p>\n<div class=\"s9\"><span class=\"s8\">\u2022 <\/span><span class=\"s4\">10% <\/span><span class=\"s4\">off of<\/span><span class=\"s4\"> League for Members<\/span><\/div>\n<p class=\"s5\"><span class=\"s4\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"s9\"><span class=\"s8\">\u2022 <\/span><span class=\"s4\">Sign up before week 1 and you will be entered into drawing for 100 free targets<\/span><\/div>\n<p class=\"s5\"><span class=\"s4\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"s9\"><span class=\"s8\">\u2022 <\/span><span class=\"s4\">League Party we will draw from the present participants for a free entry into following league<\/span><\/div>\n<p class=\"s5\"><span class=\"s4\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"s9\"><span class=\"s8\">\u2022 <\/span><span class=\"s4\">Top 5 shooters will go into FINAL on League Party Night to determine the winner. Final 25 targets to be added to your League handicap score to determine winner. \u00a0<\/span><\/div>\n<h3><b>Sign-Up:<a href=\"https:\/\/app.scorechaser.com\/tournament-0YLKEuIjRPaXE3\"> HERE<\/a><\/b><\/h3>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/app.scorechaser.com\/tournament-0YLKEuIjRPaXE3\">Sign up using Score Chaser<\/a> and utilize the \u201csquadding request\u201d function to add your teammates. ALL shooters must create a free Score Chaser account. You may also email Jessica at <a href=\"mailto:Jessica@defenderoutdoors.com\">Jessica@defenderoutdoors.com<\/a> with your team members names after they have all made an account.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Questions and Concerns:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0 <\/span><\/b>Please contact Travis Mears at <a href=\"mailto:travis@defenderoutdoors.com\">travis@defenderoutdoors.com<\/a><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"2026-fall-league","image":{"url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/CSR-Fall-League-2026-scaled-mhYu4s.jpg","id":453498,"extension":"jpg","width":1583,"height":2048,"filesize":246603,"sizes":{"medium":{"width":232,"height":300,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":22456,"url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\[long].jpg"},"large":{"width":792,"height":1024,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":186656,"url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\[long].jpg"},"thumbnail":{"width":150,"height":150,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":8616,"url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\[long].jpg"},"medium_large":{"width":768,"height":994,"mime-type":"image\/jpeg","filesize":175929,"url":"https:\/\/gunstuff.tv\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\[long].jpg"},"1536x1536":{"width":1